{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01GMJ6r97Y86a5xHYRvuFGSQ", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://revistas.usal.es/dos/index.php/1576-7914/article/download/3819/3834/12084\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.elsevier.es/es-revista-investigaciones-historia-economica-economic-328-pdf-download-S1698698905700205\"}, {\"url\": \"https://lamarea.com/2016/06/08/los-borbones-fortuna-sangre\"}, {\"url\": \"https://revistas.iea.es/index.php/ARG/article/view/1889/1884\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.lamarea.com/2016/06/07/los-primos-del-rey-aprovecharon-la-amnistia-fiscal-aflorar-mas-cuatro-millones-euros-ocultos-suiza\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.eldiario.es/politica/gobierno-orden-civil-alfonso-borbon_1_2976421.amp.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://accedacris.ulpgc.es/bitstream/10553/2638/5/%282005%29%20NAVARRA%20T%c2%ba%20y%20P%c2%ba2.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://es.hispanopedia.com/wiki/Infanta_de_Castilla\"}, {\"url\": \"https://es.hispanopedia.com/wiki/Infante_de_Castilla\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:37:46.014Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "infanzón Wikipedia \"exención fiscal\" título de infanzón dinastía Borbón", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_0161vFMy887uoKduC6gT4hxq", "content": [{"title": "revistas.usal.es", "url": "https://revistas.usal.es/dos/index.php/1576-7914/article/download/3819/3834/12084"}, {"title": "es revista investigaciones historia economica economic 328 pdf download S1698698905700205", "url": "https://www.elsevier.es/es-revista-investigaciones-historia-economica-economic-328-pdf-download-S1698698905700205"}, {"title": "Opinión | OTRAS NOTICIAS", "url": "https://lamarea.com/2016/06/08/los-borbones-fortuna-sangre"}, {"title": "iea.es", "url": "https://revistas.iea.es/index.php/ARG/article/view/1889/1884"}, {"title": "Economía | OTRAS NOTICIAS", "url": "https://www.lamarea.com/2016/06/07/los-primos-del-rey-aprovecharon-la-amnistia-fiscal-aflorar-mas-cuatro-millones-euros-ocultos-suiza"}, {"title": "El Gobierno premia con la Orden Civil de Alfonso X a un Borbón que escondía dinero en Suiza", "url": "https://www.eldiario.es/politica/gobierno-orden-civil-alfonso-borbon_1_2976421.amp.html"}, {"title": "ulpgc.es", "url": "https://accedacris.ulpgc.es/bitstream/10553/2638/5/%282005%29%20NAVARRA%20T%c2%ba%20y%20P%c2%ba2.pdf"}, {"title": "Infanta de Castilla", "url": "https://es.hispanopedia.com/wiki/Infanta_de_Castilla"}, {"title": "Infante de Castilla", "url": "https://es.hispanopedia.com/wiki/Infante_de_Castilla"}]}, "The search didn't turn up a Wikipedia article on infanzones, and nothing in the results links the infanzón title to Bourbon-era tax policy.\n\nWhat the results do cover:\n\n- **Medieval exemptions:** A Spanish historical study notes that exemptions that were only proper to some hidalgos in the Middle Ages were later extended to all people of Álava in early modern writing. That is about Álava's general exemption, not the infanzón title as such.\n- **Infanzón privileges:** A Ricardo del Arco article describes infanzones who were immune from any charge or service and were redeemed by that title. It also distinguishes infanzones by birth from those who obtained the status by royal or lordly grant, and says a grant exempts from service only the grantee and his lineage. This is a historical source, not an encyclopedia entry.\n- **Bourbon-era finance:** The results on Bourbon reforms concern 18th-century fiscal administration in Navarre, not infanzón status. The Navarre study describes the sale of the royal patrimony in the first half of the 17th century and the transformation of the tobacco monopoly into a royal revenue in 1717.\n- **Off-topic:** Most other hits concern modern Bourbon tax scandals (e.g., the 2012 tax amnesty) or the Infante title, which is unrelated to infanzones.\n\nFor a Wikipedia-sourced answer, the search would need to target the Spanish Wikipedia \"Infanzón\" article directly, or a source on how Bourbon monarchs changed hidalgo and infanzón privileges in the 18th century."], "durationSeconds": 7.021013792, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01GMJ6r97Y86a5xHYRvuFGSQ", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
